<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Microchip Tech cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Microchip Tech cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it cut its rating on Microchip Technology Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Drew Peck was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 4-3/8 at 32.</p>
</text>
